    <data key="d0">ContactSuite Contact Center Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BPvr0qWpJlA</data>
    <data key="d2">ContactSuite leverages Amazon Connect, ECS microservices, SES, Lambda, DynamoDB, and RDS to build an agile contact center platform.</data>
